📄 (experimental) Generate an OpenFeature flag manifest based on your flags configuration. ⚠️ note that this is an experimental feature and we may change this command line without warning.

Usage:
  semaphore-cli generate manifest [flags]

Flags:
  -c, --config string                      Location of your Semaphore local configuration file
      --flag_manifest_destination string   Destination of your flag manifest file. If not provided, the manifest will be printed to the console.
  -f, --format string                      Format of your input file (YAML, JSON or TOML) (default "yaml")
  -h, --help[=true|false]                  help for manifest
